{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/cdc3781e54371b9c1072f9eda2236eba.poster.avif?t=1770131747\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/cdc3781e54371b9c1072f9eda2236eba.webm?t=1770131747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/cdc3781e54371b9c1072f9eda2236eba.mp4?t=1770131747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Dicewood</u></strong> is a fantasy horror turn-based roguelike deck-builder where adorable forest animals band together to escape the relentless hunter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fleeing into a dark, twisted forest filled with ancient horrors, creepy monsters, and cannibal tribes, player must strategically combine different animals, overcome nightmarish foes, and make their way to the river to start a new life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every roll counts in this high-stakes journey of survival, teamwork, and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and collect</strong> unique dice-creatures, each with its own abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary fairytale vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck of creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will the animals be safe?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393850/extras/1abe79cf35a5c7c105a7963a5ac63ea8.poster.avif?t=1770131747\" width=600 heigh